  "steps": [
    "In a pan, add very little ghee/oil. Then add jeera, chopped garlic and green chillies and saute for a minute. Then add onion tomato paste.",
    "Cook for 2 mins on medium flame and then add all the masalas mentioned above. Now cover and cook on medium/fast flame for 4-5 minutes until everything is well combined and the mixture dries up a bit.",
    "Then add 70-80 ml milk (can add more if you want more gravy) along with malai. Mix well and add the paneer cubes with kasturi methi. Let it cook for another 5 minutes and its ready!!!"
  ],
